---
const appUrl = "https://genka-camera.vercel.app";
---

<section id="cta" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20">
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-ink px-6 py-16 text-center text-white md:py-20" data-reveal>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-0 opacity-30">
      <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-64 w-[640px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand blur-3xl"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">今日から、査定を仕組みに。</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-slate-300">
        スマホひとつで、相場の根拠のある買取査定を全スタッフに。まずは無料でお試しください。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a href={appUrl + "/login"} class="rounded-xl bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-slate-100">
          アプリを開く
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:hello@example.com?subject=買取カメラの相談" class="rounded-xl border border-white/25 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-white/10">
          導入を相談する
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
